    <string name="privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_short">No internet, no ads, no tracking. MyFile only sees the folders you choose.</string>
    <string name="privacy_long">• MyFile has no internet permission: it can\'t send anything off your phone.\n\n• No ads, analytics or third‑party libraries.\n\n• Folders are opened with the Android picker: the app only sees the ones you choose, and you can revoke access anytime.\n\n• Photos, videos and music are read only if you grant permission when opening that category.\n\n• It doesn\'t ask for location, contacts, phone, camera, microphone, Bluetooth, Wi‑Fi or root.\n\n• No cloud backups.</string>
